(4095180, 588010, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good one. Deja Vu of a Deja Vu winner.  Much better than the same one I tried to do <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=588047" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/588047.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/588047.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/76430/120/588047.jpg"/></a>, but ran out of time.  Good job on the disected drop.  Did you follow the same steps as hughletheren?  I was trying to wing it handheld on the dropper.  It would have been good to hide the platform the 2nd glass is on and to try to reduce the reflection on the table top.</td>', 'Good one. Deja Vu of a Deja Vu winner.  Much better than the same one I tried to do , but ran out of time.  Good job on the disected drop.  Did you follow the same steps as hughletheren?  I was trying to wing it handheld on the dropper.  It would have been good to hide the platform the 2nd glass is on and to try to reduce the reflection on the table top.', '2007-09-17 01:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
