(4096443, 585363, 19944, '<td valign="top">Although Larus'' original is much sharper, this is nicely done.  I more depth of field would have helped.  You seem to lose focus on the finger tips.</td>', 'Although Larus'' original is much sharper, this is nicely done.  I more depth of field would have helped.  You seem to lose focus on the finger tips.', '2007-09-17 13:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
