(4097464, 588040, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and well shot.  Not posed exactly like the original (and neither is mine), but a great take.</td>', 'Nice lighting and well shot.  Not posed exactly like the original (and neither is mine), but a great take.', '2007-09-17 20:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097473, 586018, 19944, '<td valign="top">I gotta say...I prefer yours.  I like your color scheme more and it is sharper than his.  Sorry Alex.</td>', 'I gotta say...I prefer yours.  I like your color scheme more and it is sharper than his.  Sorry Alex.', '2007-09-17 20:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097479, 587087, 19944, '<td valign="top">A sweet macro.  A little noisy.  Better than I could ever hope for.  Still gotta give the edge to Mike on this one.</td>', 'A sweet macro.  A little noisy.  Better than I could ever hope for.  Still gotta give the edge to Mike on this one.', '2007-09-17 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097486, 587100, 19944, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn close, but I have to say, Brian''s is just a tad bit sharper.  It''s sad I have to compare, because this is outstanding in it''s own right.</td>', 'Pretty darn close, but I have to say, Brian''s is just a tad bit sharper.  It''s sad I have to compare, because this is outstanding in it''s own right.', '2007-09-17 20:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097492, 587659, 19944, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, to me this isn''t really a good emulation of Manny''s work.  To me, it''s just a guy with a scarf on his head.  It''s not a bad photo.  It''s sharp and well lit.  It just doesn''t scream "MANNY LIBRODO"!</td>', 'Unfortunately, to me this isn''t really a good emulation of Manny''s work.  To me, it''s just a guy with a scarf on his head.  It''s not a bad photo.  It''s sharp and well lit.  It just doesn''t scream "MANNY LIBRODO"!', '2007-09-17 20:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097494, 587161, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the light in yours better than the original.</td>', 'I like the light in yours better than the original.', '2007-09-17 20:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097498, 584989, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely done rendition of one of librodo''s famous shots.  Maybe not as sharp, or packing the same feeling, but still, well done.</td>', 'This is a nicely done rendition of one of librodo''s famous shots.  Maybe not as sharp, or packing the same feeling, but still, well done.', '2007-09-17 20:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097508, 587294, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very close. Nice going. The lighting in the original is a little more pleasing to me. The wine had a bit of color and glow and there was a nice reflection on the glass.</td>', 'Very close. Nice going. The lighting in the original is a little more pleasing to me. The wine had a bit of color and glow and there was a nice reflection on the glass.', '2007-09-17 21:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097511, 587238, 30495, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!<br/>This photo is amazing!!</td>', 'Wow!!!This photo is amazing!!', '2007-09-17 21:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4097515, 587753, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice try -- very close. The light/contrast on the original was softer and more pleasing, and the pen was more visible. Still this is an interesting image.</td>', 'Nice try -- very close. The light/contrast on the original was softer and more pleasing, and the pen was more visible. Still this is an interesting image.', '2007-09-17 21:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
