(4099713, 588000, 69684, '<td valign="top">Almost the same cat. I like it. But when compared with the original, it could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Almost the same cat. I like it. But when compared with the original, it could be a little sharper.', '2007-09-18 20:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
