(4101775, 587941, 19944, '<td valign="top">I think I like your''s better that ursula''s.  i prefer the more vibrant colors.</td>', 'I think I like your''s better that ursula''s.  i prefer the more vibrant colors.', '2007-09-19 12:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
