(4101780, 587762, 76430, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice composition.  I like it in B/W.  Very close to the original, but I don''t think I can vote for 20% or more if I look up each original.</td>', 'Simple but nice composition.  I like it in B/W.  Very close to the original, but I don''t think I can vote for 20% or more if I look up each original.', '2007-09-19 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101800, 587664, 19944, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and color.  I like the red clips.</td>', 'Nice clarity and color.  I like the red clips.', '2007-09-19 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101807, 587491, 19944, '<td valign="top">I imitated this one in the last deja vu.  I did well with it.  I thik you will as well.  nice clarity and nice round circle.  My circle was alittle lumpy.</td>', 'I imitated this one in the last deja vu.  I did well with it.  I thik you will as well.  nice clarity and nice round circle.  My circle was alittle lumpy.', '2007-09-19 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101905, 587662, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like that your clothes are in color.  That was the one thing I didn''t like about the original.<br/> <br/>I was thinking about doing this one myself, but never found the time or the place.</td>', 'I like that your clothes are in color.  That was the one thing I didn''t like about the original. I was thinking about doing this one myself, but never found the time or the place.', '2007-09-19 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101908, 587907, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like that you used a brush instead of the roller.  i don''t know why, I just do.  Could be a little sharper, but still nicely done.</td>', 'I like that you used a brush instead of the roller.  i don''t know why, I just do.  Could be a little sharper, but still nicely done.', '2007-09-19 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101963, 585335, 43463, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur there showing the motion of the cue ball! I also love the sharp details on the cue ball, 8 ball and all those eggs (including the bumpy texture on the eggs). Lighting is also wonderful illuminating all elements of the composition. I only have one small critique (trust me, tis small) but with this being Advanced Editing I think you could have cloned out or toned down the glare on the 8-ball making the 8 more visible. Other than that this is a wonderfully done emulation of the original!</td>', 'Great motion blur there showing the motion of the cue ball! I also love the sharp details on the cue ball, 8 ball and all those eggs (including the bumpy texture on the eggs). Lighting is also wonderful illuminating all elements of the composition. I only have one small critique (trust me, tis small) but with this being Advanced Editing I think you could have cloned out or toned down the glare on the 8-ball making the 8 more visible. Other than that this is a wonderfully done emulation of the original!', '2007-09-19 13:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4101980, 587941, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great use and capture of really bold &amp; vibrantly deep colors. Love the sharp details on the smaller bubbles. Having larger ''water circles'' along with sporadic smaller bubbles creates visual interest because of the varying sizes in the shapes. Wonderfully executed and well done on your emulation of Ursula''s original.</td>', 'Wow! Great use and capture of really bold & vibrantly deep colors. Love the sharp details on the smaller bubbles. Having larger ''water circles'' along with sporadic smaller bubbles creates visual interest because of the varying sizes in the shapes. Wonderfully executed and well done on your emulation of Ursula''s original.', '2007-09-19 13:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102029, 587381, 43463, '<td valign="top">Now where on DPC have I seen this lovely, young lady before;-) I love how you closely emulated the original. The eye is immediately drawn to the girl found in the far left 1/3 of the frame. While for some circles outside of DPC the bright white background would just be inclusion of empty space that does nothing for the image in both the original &amp; the emulation. Not so, says I, it is instrumental in showing us how the girl fills that ''empty space''. Even though she only occupies 1/3 of the space her presence in the composition becomes all that more noticable &amp; powerful because our eye is drawn to the major element that serves to fill that empty space. Lighting on your model is wonderfully done - and I absolutely love the catch lights in her eyes. It just makes her eyes sparkle.</td>', 'Now where on DPC have I seen this lovely, young lady before;-) I love how you closely emulated the original. The eye is immediately drawn to the girl found in the far left 1/3 of the frame. While for some circles outside of DPC the bright white background would just be inclusion of empty space that does nothing for the image in both the original & the emulation. Not so, says I, it is instrumental in showing us how the girl fills that ''empty space''. Even though she only occupies 1/3 of the space her presence in the composition becomes all that more noticable & powerful because our eye is drawn to the major element that serves to fill that empty space. Lighting on your model is wonderfully done - and I absolutely love the catch lights in her eyes. It just makes her eyes sparkle.', '2007-09-19 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102041, 587311, 43463, '<td valign="top">It is the lines and curves along with the ''electric'' blue lines along the black surface that really captures and draws the eye in. It is very hypnotic in both the original and this emulation. Great details, color and lighting in this composition! Well done.</td>', 'It is the lines and curves along with the ''electric'' blue lines along the black surface that really captures and draws the eye in. It is very hypnotic in both the original and this emulation. Great details, color and lighting in this composition! Well done.', '2007-09-19 14:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102076, 588000, 43463, '<td valign="top">It is the amber golden glow of the cat''s eyes that draw the viewer in for they are very hypnotic. Colors and lighting is great. The area that needs a tad more improvement is the sharpness in the details of this feline. The lack of sharpness is most noticeable on the whiskers of the cat. It''s the sharpness in the detail that would move this from out of the above average category and into the stellar category. Generally a higher aperture (6.3 and above)and an ISO of 50-100 will give you a sharper DOF and greater detail. Of course, you would have to use a slower shutter speed and a cat is sometimes notorious for not cooperating when you want them too:-)None-the-less, good job on emulating the original.</td>', 'It is the amber golden glow of the cat''s eyes that draw the viewer in for they are very hypnotic. Colors and lighting is great. The area that needs a tad more improvement is the sharpness in the details of this feline. The lack of sharpness is most noticeable on the whiskers of the cat. It''s the sharpness in the detail that would move this from out of the above average category and into the stellar category. Generally a higher aperture (6.3 and above)and an ISO of 50-100 will give you a sharper DOF and greater detail. Of course, you would have to use a slower shutter speed and a cat is sometimes notorious for not cooperating when you want them too:-)None-the-less, good job on emulating the original.', '2007-09-19 14:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102104, 587648, 43463, '<td valign="top">Your lighting is wonderful in this composition for it illuminates all the elements within. Colors are also great. And extra kudos to you for making the edges of the book pages nice and sharp as well as rounding them to the exact shape of the apple. They really look like they fit in there! Sharpness and details are wonderful I can ''read'' and see the words clearly. I also like soft focus of the two apple seeds in the background...I guess that is the dual core that you ''plug'' in:-)You did a fine job on emulating the original.</td>', 'Your lighting is wonderful in this composition for it illuminates all the elements within. Colors are also great. And extra kudos to you for making the edges of the book pages nice and sharp as well as rounding them to the exact shape of the apple. They really look like they fit in there! Sharpness and details are wonderful I can ''read'' and see the words clearly. I also like soft focus of the two apple seeds in the background...I guess that is the dual core that you ''plug'' in:-)You did a fine job on emulating the original.', '2007-09-19 14:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102327, 587254, 65468, '<td valign="top">The shot by Larus is one of my favorites of his wife Henny.  This is a great tribute to that image.  I don''t know how you get such beautiful women to cover themselves with dirt for the sake of art but the results are wonderful.</td>', 'The shot by Larus is one of my favorites of his wife Henny.  This is a great tribute to that image.  I don''t know how you get such beautiful women to cover themselves with dirt for the sake of art but the results are wonderful.', '2007-09-19 16:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102330, 587806, 58452, '<td valign="top">Of the two of these, I like this one best.  Close though..  I think the lighting is closer to the original.</td>', 'Of the two of these, I like this one best.  Close though..  I think the lighting is closer to the original.', '2007-09-19 16:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102358, 587294, 65468, '<td valign="top">The high key background in contrast to the cork and container are great offsets to this image, the detail of the glass stem and base are fine but the lack of depth in the glass rim and lack of clarity and color of the wine(?) detract from the image impact.</td>', 'The high key background in contrast to the cork and container are great offsets to this image, the detail of the glass stem and base are fine but the lack of depth in the glass rim and lack of clarity and color of the wine(?) detract from the image impact.', '2007-09-19 16:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102377, 585363, 65468, '<td valign="top">The lack of luster in the hands detracts from the lighting and impact of this image IMO</td>', 'The lack of luster in the hands detracts from the lighting and impact of this image IMO', '2007-09-19 16:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102409, 585236, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good shot looking very much like the original.</td>', 'Good shot looking very much like the original.', '2007-09-19 16:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102424, 587886, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mixing of the milk and coffee in the drop ring.  The threads through the circle are almost like one of Ursula''s fairy like seed images.  I think you''ve certainly done justice to IreneM''s image.</td>', 'Beautiful mixing of the milk and coffee in the drop ring.  The threads through the circle are almost like one of Ursula''s fairy like seed images.  I think you''ve certainly done justice to IreneM''s image.', '2007-09-19 16:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102428, 586120, 58452, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary detail and beautiful rendition of the colors.</td>', 'Extraordinary detail and beautiful rendition of the colors.', '2007-09-19 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102431, 585363, 76430, '<td valign="top">Close, though your hands are dirty and Larus'' were grimey and your wrists and rings aren''t positioned the same.</td>', 'Close, though your hands are dirty and Larus'' were grimey and your wrists and rings aren''t positioned the same.', '2007-09-19 16:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102436, 588038, 58452, '<td valign="top">Something really interesting about this image. The softness of the face almost makes it look like the side of a sand dune. I like the contrast of the reddish side with the face across the diagonal.</td>', 'Something really interesting about this image. The softness of the face almost makes it look like the side of a sand dune. I like the contrast of the reddish side with the face across the diagonal.', '2007-09-19 16:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102440, 585034, 58452, '<td valign="top">I liked the original a lot and I like this  one as well.  Love the green and the branching while the frog shadow keeps bringing the eye back into the composition.</td>', 'I liked the original a lot and I like this  one as well.  Love the green and the branching while the frog shadow keeps bringing the eye back into the composition.', '2007-09-19 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102441, 587648, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good emulation.  Like I commented on the original, I''d like to see smaller font and wrapped text rather than cut-off, but to emulate it I guess you had to do this.  You did a better job on the edges.</td>', 'Good emulation.  Like I commented on the original, I''d like to see smaller font and wrapped text rather than cut-off, but to emulate it I guess you had to do this.  You did a better job on the edges.', '2007-09-19 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102450, 586833, 58452, '<td valign="top">A captivating portrait of this cat.  Love the textures and those beautiful eyes.</td>', 'A captivating portrait of this cat.  Love the textures and those beautiful eyes.', '2007-09-19 16:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102455, 587275, 58452, '<td valign="top">Mutt or nut, what''s the difference? Just as funny as the first one.  Excellent.</td>', 'Mutt or nut, what''s the difference? Just as funny as the first one.  Excellent.', '2007-09-19 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102475, 587934, 76430, '<td valign="top">I guess it''s a dead butterfly like the original making it easy to get the butterfly on the same spot as the original.  Good job even though the iron, steam and butterfly positioning aren''t quite the same.</td>', 'I guess it''s a dead butterfly like the original making it easy to get the butterfly on the same spot as the original.  Good job even though the iron, steam and butterfly positioning aren''t quite the same.', '2007-09-19 16:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102480, 588007, 58452, '<td valign="top">Certainly a more sinister version of Yanko''s cat.  Maybe just a touch more DOF, but still very nice.</td>', 'Certainly a more sinister version of Yanko''s cat.  Maybe just a touch more DOF, but still very nice.', '2007-09-19 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102491, 588017, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nicer coloring than the original with the CD under it, but it''s missing the great pattern of rings around the paper clips the original had, demonstrating surface tension.  What are the bubbles about?  It looks like they clips aren''t floating like the original but just sitting on the CD.  Nice sharp image.</td>', 'Nicer coloring than the original with the CD under it, but it''s missing the great pattern of rings around the paper clips the original had, demonstrating surface tension.  What are the bubbles about?  It looks like they clips aren''t floating like the original but just sitting on the CD.  Nice sharp image.', '2007-09-19 16:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102494, 587927, 58452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blending of the pastels of the "hat" with the face and blouse.  The eyes are especially riveting.  A touch more definition on the lines below the eyes would have helped a bit.  Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful blending of the pastels of the "hat" with the face and blouse.  The eyes are especially riveting.  A touch more definition on the lines below the eyes would have helped a bit.  Very nice.', '2007-09-19 16:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102498, 587932, 58452, '<td valign="top">Very nice flame shape and brilliance while still preserving the natural color of the wood and unburnt match head.  Excellent effort.</td>', 'Very nice flame shape and brilliance while still preserving the natural color of the wood and unburnt match head.  Excellent effort.', '2007-09-19 16:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102504, 585176, 58452, '<td valign="top">A little better exposure on this version than your competitor, and I love the spiral distortion in the middle of the sphere.  Very nice.</td>', 'A little better exposure on this version than your competitor, and I love the spiral distortion in the middle of the sphere.  Very nice.', '2007-09-19 16:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102507, 586830, 76430, '<td valign="top">I think I remember this one, but I''m having trouble finding it with the title clues you gave.  No strings match from what I can see.  It looks very good, though I don''t know what to compare it to.  There is a little glare from the light source to the right of the filter especially.</td>', 'I think I remember this one, but I''m having trouble finding it with the title clues you gave.  No strings match from what I can see.  It looks very good, though I don''t know what to compare it to.  There is a little glare from the light source to the right of the filter especially.', '2007-09-19 16:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102511, 585239, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very good re-creation.</td>', 'Very good re-creation.', '2007-09-19 17:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102518, 587665, 58452, '<td valign="top">A very eerie version of this image.  The placement of hands and reflections of same almost creates a grinning "deaths head" in the center of the image.  Almost wearing a crown.  Maybe saying that when man wages war, it rules over life.  It also seems to display the increasing age of those who were victimized by that war.  I like it.  It''s disturbing.  Bumping it up a point while commenting.</td>', 'A very eerie version of this image.  The placement of hands and reflections of same almost creates a grinning "deaths head" in the center of the image.  Almost wearing a crown.  Maybe saying that when man wages war, it rules over life.  It also seems to display the increasing age of those who were victimized by that war.  I like it.  It''s disturbing.  Bumping it up a point while commenting.', '2007-09-19 17:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102519, 587976, 19944, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring of yours better and I like that the tiger is right up against the glass.  His is a tad sharper, though.  Tough call on which is better.</td>', 'I like the coloring of yours better and I like that the tiger is right up against the glass.  His is a tad sharper, though.  Tough call on which is better.', '2007-09-19 17:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102524, 587238, 19944, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but am bothered by the yellow/orange area on the left.  I''m not sure what it is and I think it lowers the quality of the shot.<br/> <br/>As far as matching Sherwin''s original...nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this, but am bothered by the yellow/orange area on the left.  I''m not sure what it is and I think it lowers the quality of the shot. As far as matching Sherwin''s original...nicely done.', '2007-09-19 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102528, 586868, 58452, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this one as well as the range of dark tones.  Excellent effort.</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this one as well as the range of dark tones.  Excellent effort.', '2007-09-19 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102529, 586892, 19944, '<td valign="top">Well lit and sharp where it needs to be.  Ido prefer the shallower DOF of the original.</td>', 'Well lit and sharp where it needs to be.  Ido prefer the shallower DOF of the original.', '2007-09-19 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4102530, 587715, 76430, '<td valign="top">Well done, other than not getting the well defined concentric circles Jacko did.</td>', 'Well done, other than not getting the well defined concentric circles Jacko did.', '2007-09-19 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
