(4102563, 584820, 19944, '<td valign="top">This is a bit noisey and harshly lit.  I''m not a big fan of the big shadow behind the dragon.</td>', 'This is a bit noisey and harshly lit.  I''m not a big fan of the big shadow behind the dragon.', '2007-09-19 17:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
