(4103025, 587832, 41337, '<td valign="top">The other shot in this challenge looks and feels more like Larus''s photo in general, but this one is more captivating and matches what Larus had going with his model. If that makes sense.</td>', 'The other shot in this challenge looks and feels more like Larus''s photo in general, but this one is more captivating and matches what Larus had going with his model. If that makes sense.', '2007-09-19 20:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
