(4104774, 587254, 64446, '<td valign="top">Impressive the details and similarity with the original, which leads me to think you put up a lot to come up with this image. Beautiful (and likely patient) model. It is really outstanding!<br/>The only differences being their expressions(here more serene, the original more like "what''s up") and a slight head tilt in the original. Absolutely nothing to take away your 10.</td>', 'Impressive the details and similarity with the original, which leads me to think you put up a lot to come up with this image. Beautiful (and likely patient) model. It is really outstanding!The only differences being their expressions(here more serene, the original more like "what''s up") and a slight head tilt in the original. Absolutely nothing to take away your 10.', '2007-09-20 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4104794, 587238, 64446, '<td valign="top">I hope Sherwin doesnt get offended, but I like yours more, with an amazinglighting and lively colors tones! I''d love to see your set up on this one. This is my top 1 favorite of the challenge. Congratulations!</td>', 'I hope Sherwin doesnt get offended, but I like yours more, with an amazinglighting and lively colors tones! I''d love to see your set up on this one. This is my top 1 favorite of the challenge. Congratulations!', '2007-09-20 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
