(4109896, 586199, 27133, '<td valign="top">Have a look at the original.  Really study it.  Work out what makes it a winner.  Be really drastic in your findings...then compare the two and you will understand what you need to do to bring your version to the same standard.  I am saying this to help you...please take it in the way I intended.</td>', 'Have a look at the original.  Really study it.  Work out what makes it a winner.  Be really drastic in your findings...then compare the two and you will understand what you need to do to bring your version to the same standard.  I am saying this to help you...please take it in the way I intended.', '2007-09-23 03:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
