(4110013, 588038, 27133, '<td valign="top">Although this has a different angle and lighting, I really do like the soft touch of this image.  Beautiful.</td>', 'Although this has a different angle and lighting, I really do like the soft touch of this image.  Beautiful.', '2007-09-23 09:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
