(4110187, 585034, 64446, '<td valign="top">Excellent details on the leaf. Love how you got a 3D effect on it.<br/>Now that we all know about the silhouette, one could spot some "imperfections" there, but taht doesn''t take away anything from the image. Nicely done!!!</td>', 'Excellent details on the leaf. Love how you got a 3D effect on it.Now that we all know about the silhouette, one could spot some "imperfections" there, but taht doesn''t take away anything from the image. Nicely done!!!', '2007-09-23 11:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
