(4111411, 586207, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow, ya done good!  Congrats!  :-)<br/> <br/>Like a couple of others mentioned, I think I would have preferred a little blur to the wings.  I mean, it''s totally awesome that you froze the wings and managed to get such perfect detail.  But a little blur to the wings makes it feel more alive.<br/> <br/>Oh... I just looked at your other hummingbird shots.  WOW!  Holy cow!  You have some awesome shots ... #1 and #2 are totally amazing!  If this one had been a little more like those two, I think it would have easily blown past my score.  :-)<br/></td>', 'Wow, ya done good!  Congrats!  :-) Like a couple of others mentioned, I think I would have preferred a little blur to the wings.  I mean, it''s totally awesome that you froze the wings and managed to get such perfect detail.  But a little blur to the wings makes it feel more alive. Oh... I just looked at your other hummingbird shots.  WOW!  Holy cow!  You have some awesome shots ... #1 and #2 are totally amazing!  If this one had been a little more like those two, I think it would have easily blown past my score.  :-)', '2007-09-24 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4111412, 586120, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dang, woman, this is one helluva good recreation of that shot!  Congrats on the great score to go with it, too!</td>', 'Dang, woman, this is one helluva good recreation of that shot!  Congrats on the great score to go with it, too!', '2007-09-24 01:14:21.000000', NULL, 0),
