(4111425, 587381, 19982, '<td valign="top">I think the processing on your surpasses the original!  The only "nit" I would pick is that there isn''t a clear view of either eye.  I like the hair flying and don''t mind it covering the eyes... I would just feel more connected to the girl if I thought she could "see me" by staring out through her picture.</td>', 'I think the processing on your surpasses the original!  The only "nit" I would pick is that there isn''t a clear view of either eye.  I like the hair flying and don''t mind it covering the eyes... I would just feel more connected to the girl if I thought she could "see me" by staring out through her picture.', '2007-09-24 01:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4111426, 586235, 5112, '<td valign="top">Many congratulations on your very first ribbon, and a blue at that!  Beautiful image.</td>', 'Many congratulations on your very first ribbon, and a blue at that!  Beautiful image.', '2007-09-24 01:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
