(4111447, 586120, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Julianne!  This is spectacular and oh, so close to the original.  In fact, I''m scratching my head as to why it didn''t score even higher.  Congrats on your new second-best!</td>', 'Congrats, Julianne!  This is spectacular and oh, so close to the original.  In fact, I''m scratching my head as to why it didn''t score even higher.  Congrats on your new second-best!', '2007-09-24 01:21:16.000000', NULL, 0),
