(4111501, 587828, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  This was the one image that I thought was a pixel-for-pixel match when I first saw it.  Even though I then saw it wasn''t, that impression stayed with me, and I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Congrats!  This was the one image that I thought was a pixel-for-pixel match when I first saw it.  Even though I then saw it wasn''t, that impression stayed with me, and I gave it a 10.', '2007-09-24 01:33:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4111503, 588036, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wow, not a single score of less than 5, and only 8 5''s. This may be a record, certainly damned close to one, for fewest 5-and-under scores.<br/> <br/>Great work!<br/> <br/>It is interesting that you would say this: "This is my first true ribbon. The other one was due to a DQ of someone else''s entry." <br/> <br/>MY point of view would be the opposite; the ribbon due to DQ is absolutely legitimate, because an image that scored higher was found not to be legal. This one, on the other hand, is a special category of ribbon to me, because it is entirely technical in nature; someone else provided the inspiration, and you replicated the result perfectly. This, of course, is what everyone tried to do, and you did it better than practically all the others.<br/> <br/>Congrats!</td>', 'Wow, not a single score of less than 5, and only 8 5''s. This may be a record, certainly damned close to one, for fewest 5-and-under scores. Great work! It is interesting that you would say this: "This is my first true ribbon. The other one was due to a DQ of someone else''s entry."  MY point of view would be the opposite; the ribbon due to DQ is absolutely legitimate, because an image that scored higher was found not to be legal. This one, on the other hand, is a special category of ribbon to me, because it is entirely technical in nature; someone else provided the inspiration, and you replicated the result perfectly. This, of course, is what everyone tried to do, and you did it better than practically all the others. Congrats!', '2007-09-24 01:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4111505, 586235, 52549, '<td valign="top">What a stunning image! Congratulations on your blue ribbon.</td>', 'What a stunning image! Congratulations on your blue ribbon.', '2007-09-24 01:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
