(4111554, 587294, 25678, '<td valign="top">Oh wow! You did an awesome job emulating my shot, but I must say, I think you need to drink some more wine to get some more corks ;-)<br/> <br/>kudos to you!<br/> <br/>ETA: my only nitpick is with advanced rules, I may have cloned out the reflections.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-24 00:48:09.</i></td>', 'Oh wow! You did an awesome job emulating my shot, but I must say, I think you need to drink some more wine to get some more corks ;-) kudos to you! ETA: my only nitpick is with advanced rules, I may have cloned out the reflections.', '2007-09-24 01:46:48.000000', '2007-09-24 01:48:09.000000', 0),
(4111557, 587251, 20168, '<td valign="top">Congrats Jason on your stunning replica! I was getting worried about you...I hadn''t seen one of your photos in ribbon land in the past week or two :)</td>', 'Congrats Jason on your stunning replica! I was getting worried about you...I hadn''t seen one of your photos in ribbon land in the past week or two :)', '2007-09-24 01:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
