(4111577, 587662, 44304, '<td valign="top">This is a great re-take of my old shot from the selective desat challenge.  I think you did a fine job capturing the scene, and I agree with many of the comments given.  I, too, like how you put the painter in color against the black and white background to make them stand out more.  This was an improvement over the original.  I''m flattered you chose my shot, and impressed with the result.</td>', 'This is a great re-take of my old shot from the selective desat challenge.  I think you did a fine job capturing the scene, and I agree with many of the comments given.  I, too, like how you put the painter in color against the black and white background to make them stand out more.  This was an improvement over the original.  I''m flattered you chose my shot, and impressed with the result.', '2007-09-24 01:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
