(4112209, 587871, 32084, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I never, ever thought that I would bump into a Déjà vu of one of my shots.  I must say I am flattered and thank you.  I think you did a great job.  I totally get those 5 hours you put in  the lighting on this was tough for me as I struggled to get what it was that I had in my head  it was probably just the emotion of that day that was eventually responsible for the required random error to get what I was feeling and was after.  Thanks again and great job.<br/> <br/>Chris</td>', 'Wow!  I never, ever thought that I would bump into a Déjà vu of one of my shots.  I must say I am flattered and thank you.  I think you did a great job.  I totally get those 5 hours you put in  the lighting on this was tough for me as I struggled to get what it was that I had in my head  it was probably just the emotion of that day that was eventually responsible for the required random error to get what I was feeling and was after.  Thanks again and great job. Chris', '2007-09-24 10:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
