(4112537, 587251, 656, '<td valign="top">There''s a couple of things I like about the original a bit more, but this is a great copy.  The strong blue triangle in the original keeps the composition flowing more, along with the overall better sharpness and selective focus that again keeps my eye moving around.<br/> <br/>I think you did a great job recreating the general style and feel of the shot though.</td>', 'There''s a couple of things I like about the original a bit more, but this is a great copy.  The strong blue triangle in the original keeps the composition flowing more, along with the overall better sharpness and selective focus that again keeps my eye moving around. I think you did a great job recreating the general style and feel of the shot though.', '2007-09-24 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 0),
