(4112951, 588036, 67237, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>It is interesting that you would say this: "This is my first true ribbon. The other one was due to a DQ of someone else''s entry." <br/> <br/>MY point of view would be the opposite; the ribbon due to DQ is absolutely legitimate, because an image that scored higher was found not to be legal. This one, on the other hand, is a special category of ribbon to me, because it is entirely technical in nature; someone else provided the inspiration, and you replicated the result perfectly. This, of course, is what everyone tried to do, and you did it better than practically all the others.<br/> <br/>Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>THANKS BEAR!! AND THANKS EVERYONE FOR ALL THESE NICE COMMENTS</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: It is interesting that you would say this: "This is my first true ribbon. The other one was due to a DQ of someone else''s entry."  MY point of view would be the opposite; the ribbon due to DQ is absolutely legitimate, because an image that scored higher was found not to be legal. This one, on the other hand, is a special category of ribbon to me, because it is entirely technical in nature; someone else provided the inspiration, and you replicated the result perfectly. This, of course, is what everyone tried to do, and you did it better than practically all the others. Congrats!   THANKS BEAR!! AND THANKS EVERYONE FOR ALL THESE NICE COMMENTS', '2007-09-24 17:36:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4112960, 587917, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lol, I think I just wet myself.  This is classic.</td>', 'Lol, I think I just wet myself.  This is classic.', '2007-09-24 17:43:47.000000', NULL, 0),
