(4116929, 587328, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think this is an absolutely lovely shot. The color contrast between blue and yellow is pleasing and soothing. I really like that you didn''t copy the original shot - you just used the idea as inspiration and created your own unique version.</td>', 'I think this is an absolutely lovely shot. The color contrast between blue and yellow is pleasing and soothing. I really like that you didn''t copy the original shot - you just used the idea as inspiration and created your own unique version.', '2007-09-26 09:49:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116942, 588007, 66597, '<td valign="top">Colleen - I''m a fan of cat shots in general (being a cat lover, I suppose) and find this one most interesting. I will say there''s a big difference in feeling between this and Yanko''s shot, though. This one is slightly menacing, while his is warm. I will say I like this just as well as Yanko''s but in a totally different way.</td>', 'Colleen - I''m a fan of cat shots in general (being a cat lover, I suppose) and find this one most interesting. I will say there''s a big difference in feeling between this and Yanko''s shot, though. This one is slightly menacing, while his is warm. I will say I like this just as well as Yanko''s but in a totally different way.', '2007-09-26 09:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116953, 587941, 66597, '<td valign="top">You really managed to get a lot of depth in this photo, and the composition is quite interesting. I''m not quite as fond of the primary colors as Ursula''s softer hues, but that is a stylistic choice. This is well done and seeing inspires me to want to try it for myself!</td>', 'You really managed to get a lot of depth in this photo, and the composition is quite interesting. I''m not quite as fond of the primary colors as Ursula''s softer hues, but that is a stylistic choice. This is well done and seeing inspires me to want to try it for myself!', '2007-09-26 09:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4116955, 587907, 66597, '<td valign="top">I thought this would score higher. You did a great job with subject placement and grabbing interest with the choice of color swaths. Well done!</td>', 'I thought this would score higher. You did a great job with subject placement and grabbing interest with the choice of color swaths. Well done!', '2007-09-26 09:55:56.000000', NULL, 0),
