(4117649, 588000, 65319, '<td valign="top">I loved <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41337" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yanko</a>''s original and marked it as a favorite during that challenge!  Now I''m marking yours a fav as well...two cats are better than one...right?!!!  Excellent work, Sandy!!  He should be very pleased with your rendition!<br/> <br/>(PS...my blue-eyed cat, Sammy, gets jealous....Shhhh!!!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-26 13:23:24.</i></td>', 'I loved  Yanko''s original and marked it as a favorite during that challenge!  Now I''m marking yours a fav as well...two cats are better than one...right?!!!  Excellent work, Sandy!!  He should be very pleased with your rendition! (PS...my blue-eyed cat, Sammy, gets jealous....Shhhh!!!)', '2007-09-26 14:22:41.000000', '2007-09-26 14:23:24.000000', 0),
