(4123984, 588025, 16672, '<td valign="top">Hey your focus is soft the image is very dark and really no definition of the ball itself. Having a light bouncing of the glass might help distiguish the glass and make the inside electric view more crisp and impressive. The colors are a bit to saturated. The image is alright but with some work could be more impressive. You could maybe even contrast the back ground with another color like a bright green, orange, or yellow. WOrk with it.</td>', 'Hey your focus is soft the image is very dark and really no definition of the ball itself. Having a light bouncing of the glass might help distiguish the glass and make the inside electric view more crisp and impressive. The colors are a bit to saturated. The image is alright but with some work could be more impressive. You could maybe even contrast the back ground with another color like a bright green, orange, or yellow. WOrk with it.', '2007-09-29 07:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
