(4130594, 588000, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''ve looked at this one of yours before but didnt comment coz i was feeling a bit low .. when i''m feeling that way i cant put across sufficiently well how i feel about a photograph .. i''m feeling fine right now so i can say quite easily ..... BRILLIANT .. !!! <br/>love the eyes especially .. <br/>you are a killer photographer .. amazing .. your work with children and animals is to die for .. i think someone in the movie industry said something along the lines ''never work with children and animals'' .. he couldnt have been as talented as you ..  i think it may''v been alfred hitchcock !!!!! .. of course his was a different medium .. i''m being very flattering i know .. but i admire your work so much ... :) ..<br/>anyhoooo the eyes are amazing .. how you got that white dot in the middle is literally genius .. well at my level of expertise it seems that way !! .. those whiskers are wonderful .. smudge is an absolutely fantastic subject ..:)x<br/><i>edit ...</i> i spelt smudge''s name wrong .. i had smidge !!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-01 17:57:46.</i></td>', 'i''ve looked at this one of yours before but didnt comment coz i was feeling a bit low .. when i''m feeling that way i cant put across sufficiently well how i feel about a photograph .. i''m feeling fine right now so i can say quite easily ..... BRILLIANT .. !!! love the eyes especially .. you are a killer photographer .. amazing .. your work with children and animals is to die for .. i think someone in the movie industry said something along the lines ''never work with children and animals'' .. he couldnt have been as talented as you ..  i think it may''v been alfred hitchcock !!!!! .. of course his was a different medium .. i''m being very flattering i know .. but i admire your work so much ... :) ..anyhoooo the eyes are amazing .. how you got that white dot in the middle is literally genius .. well at my level of expertise it seems that way !! .. those whiskers are wonderful .. smudge is an absolutely fantastic subject ..:)xedit ... i spelt smudge''s name wrong .. i had smidge !!', '2007-10-01 18:56:37.000000', '2007-10-01 18:57:46.000000', 0),
