(4703260, 586830, 66384, '<td valign="top">I have really enjoyed reading the notes on this BRILLIANT photograph. It is truly a masterpiece. All the careful work you did really paid off. I think many of the details, such as the rings surrounding the names were lost on the quick voters.<br/> <br/>As for the comparison to Konador''s original, I think you took a good idea and really ran with it. Besides giving meaning to the heart shadow, you have made many other significant improvements. I like the softer contrast for illustrating love, I think the softer, heart-shaped general lighting is better, and of course the printed pages give a purpose to the whole image. <br/> <br/>I hope you have found other audiences for this. You have inspired me to put more effort into my work. Thank you.<br/> <br/><i>edited for typo</i>.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-14 22:50:34.</i></td>', 'I have really enjoyed reading the notes on this BRILLIANT photograph. It is truly a masterpiece. All the careful work you did really paid off. I think many of the details, such as the rings surrounding the names were lost on the quick voters. As for the comparison to Konador''s original, I think you took a good idea and really ran with it. Besides giving meaning to the heart shadow, you have made many other significant improvements. I like the softer contrast for illustrating love, I think the softer, heart-shaped general lighting is better, and of course the printed pages give a purpose to the whole image.  I hope you have found other audiences for this. You have inspired me to put more effort into my work. Thank you. edited for typo.', '2008-05-14 23:48:53.000000', '2008-05-14 23:50:34.000000', 0),
